EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Please complete the attached form and send back with:

Voided check for new account
Previous account: {!Case.Last_Month__c} and transactions history to the date of account closing.
Please answer the following questions:

o Why the need for Modification?

o When will you be able to resume full payments?

o When will you be able to catch up missed payments?

New account: {!Case.Two_Months_Ago__c} and {!Case.Last_Month__c} bank statements and a month to date transaction history for {!Case.Current_Month__c}

OR if account was just opened, please provide a letter from the bank detailing: Account Name, Account Number, Routing Number, and Current balance.



*all missed payments will require a catchup plan to be setup within 1 month of payment resuming*



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
